    "message": "Prove spatial reachability and propagation over the exact aligned cell cycle\n\nConstruct inverse cell permutations at plus/minus2011 in the full cyclic word, prove arbitrary iterates and period N, and reach every cell from any starting base in fewer than N steps. Export predicate propagation without any word, tile or occupation premise.\n\nBind canonical Cell N equivalences with Fin N and ZMod N to the actual field-base quotient and explicitly retain the singleton case. Record complete independent review, two fresh direct Lean replays and sixteen standard-only axiom reports; leave equation display and size metrics unchanged.",
